<title>PERU: Telefonica del Peru to issue 80 mln sol debt Mon.</title>
<headline>Telefonica del Peru to issue 80 mln sol debt Mon.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish-owned Telefonica del Peru said Friday it will auction 80 million soles worth of short-term commercial debt on the local market April 14.</p>
<p>The issue, which will be the third in a global program of issues for a total of up to $180 million, will include 30-day, 90-day and one-year bills, the company said in an announcement published in the local press.</p>
<p>Telefonica del Peru is controlled by Telefonica de Espana.</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
